    "description": "<p>Creatures of darkness that would target the Sidereal's unit suffer a -1 external penalty to all relevant rolls. When demons engage the unit in close combat, this penalty extends to all of their non-reflexive actions. Multiple Sidereals may stack this Charm on the same unit; the maximum stacked penalty equals the lowest Essence rating among the Sidereals involved. A Sidereal with Essence 4+ who has trained the unit with a Training Mandate Charm may extend this protection to shaped Fair Folk as well. An army can benefit from only one Battle Pattern Charm in a given battle.</p>",
